    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail your flat check to avoid dying from your heritage’s benefits or you lose your limbs or head.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">Even when your body has shut down, your heart manages to pump at the end of your life. In this moment, you manage to live once again. When you use this action, you succeed instead of failing your flat check, or you regrow your lost limbs and head instantly. This can also prevent your death if the loss of your body part was the cause of your death.</span></p>"
